object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Family%20Brooch%20%28Dwarven%29\">Family Brooch (Dwarven)</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Brooch\">Silver Brooch</a>.\nYou have to do the <a href=\"#/quest/the-white-raven-monastery-quest\">Family Brooch Quest</a> to get this item.<br/>\nGive this item to <a href=\"#/wiki/Dalbrect\">Dalbrect</a> to get his permission to travel for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Bert\">Black Bert</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">After completing <a href=\"#/quest/the-thieves-guild-quest\">The Thieves Guild Quest</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-